  "title": "Apple Maps Renames Lake Ontario to 'Lake America'",
  "summary": "Apple Maps will show Lake Ontario as 'Lake America' after President Donald Trump ordered the change, which aligns with a shift in international policy. Meanwhile, MapQuest and the U.S. government are responding with different names, highlighting a broader naming policy debate.",
